---
// Uncontrolled: PostList.astro's script reads it on `input`. Focus rings are
// solid amber-ink / blue-light: half-alpha rings miss 3:1 on the canvas.
---

<input
  id="search"
  type="search"
  aria-label="search article by tag or title"
  placeholder="Search by title or tag"
  class="w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-navy bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xl text-text placeholder:text-subtitle focus:shadow-md focus:ring-2 focus:shadow-amber focus:ring-amber-ink focus:outline-none dark:border-blue-light dark:bg-dark-bg dark:text-text-dark dark:placeholder:text-text-dark/75 dark:focus:shadow-box-dark dark:focus:ring-blue-light"
/>
